WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.390 --> 00:00:02.520
- [Narrator] The world's
most famous escape artist,

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:04.010
Harry Houdini.

00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:06.640
He thrilled audiences
with dazzling illusions

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:09.120
and death-defying stunts.

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:12.650
This mastermind was from
here, Budapest, Hungary.

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:14.600
A city obsessed with escaping

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:18.670
and the escape legacy still
continues, thanks to this guy.

00:00:19.630 --> 00:00:20.820
- Welcome to ParaPark.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:27.150
Escape rooms, find the clue,

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:28.970
solve the riddle, crack the code.

00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:31.890
These team building puzzles are popping up

00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:33.090
all over the planet.

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:36.750
In fact, here in Budapest,
there are over 80 of them.

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:40.500
But back in 2010, escape
rooms didn't exist.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:42.900
It was only ’til this
man thought up the idea.

00:00:58.328 --> 00:01:02.123
- His speciality was playing
problem solving computer games

00:01:02.123 --> 00:01:02.956
but then.

00:01:07.783 --> 00:01:09.683
- So within three months,
Attila had quit his job,

00:01:09.683 --> 00:01:11.507
found a space in Budapest

00:01:11.507 --> 00:01:14.924
and opened the world's first escape room.

00:01:27.264 --> 00:01:29.605
- An escape room works like this:

00:01:29.605 --> 00:01:32.630
You and your friends are locked
in a room for 60 minutes.

00:01:32.630 --> 00:01:33.940
You are then tasked with finding clues

00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:36.177
and solving puzzles to unlock the door,

00:01:36.177 --> 00:01:38.344
and thus escape that room.

00:02:27.237 --> 00:02:29.298
- So if you ever find yourself in Budapest,

00:02:29.298 --> 00:02:32.273
and you're stuck inside one
of its many escape rooms, like,

00:02:32.273 --> 00:02:34.962
let's say the Mob House or a jail cell,

00:02:34.962 --> 00:02:36.773
just remember to thank Attila.

00:02:36.773 --> 00:02:39.202
One of the latest in this
cities launch edition

00:02:39.202 --> 00:02:42.116
of Getting out of Hairy Situations.

00:02:42.116 --> 00:02:44.699
(bright music)

